      <title>Fernando Hidalgo Pineda receives UMass-BW scholarship</title>
      <link>http://asgard-ari.github.io/post/2026-04-20-fernando-umass-bw-scholarship/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0200</pubDate>
      <guid>http://asgard-ari.github.io/post/2026-04-20-fernando-umass-bw-scholarship/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Fernando Hidalgo Pineda has been selected for a research stay at the University of Massachusetts Amherst in fall 2026, through the Baden-Wurttemberg-UMass coordinated by the University of Hohenheim.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;He has been awarded a scholarship funded by the Ministry of Science, Research and the Arts, Baden-Wurttemberg, to support the visit. Congratulations, Fernando!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
